	<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Infrastructure Manager</skos:altLabel>
	<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">IM</skos:altLabel>
	<skos:definition xml:lang="en"> A body or firm responsible for the operation, maintenance and renewal of railway infrastructure on a network, as well as responsible for participating in its development as determined by the Member State within the framework of its general policy on development and financing of infrastructure</skos:definition>
